1
00:00:46,798 --> 00:00:52,071
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,096 --> 00:00:54,053
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:54,053 --> 00:00:55,873
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,897 --> 00:00:58,837
=Episode 23=

5
00:01:06,079 --> 00:01:06,680
So...

6
00:01:08,159 --> 00:01:09,079
it was you.

7
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:12,920
He's Mian.

8
00:01:13,079 --> 00:01:13,959
Mian.

9
00:01:14,799 --> 00:01:16,439
It's the warden!

10
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:18,200
Mian finally showed himself.

11
00:01:20,079 --> 00:01:20,599
Dad.

12
00:01:21,879 --> 00:01:22,480
You're here.

13
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:24,040
If I hadn't shown up,

14
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:26,120
your big day

15
00:01:26,799 --> 00:01:27,840
would've been a disaster.

16
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:31,760
What?

17
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:33,319
Surprised to find out

18
00:01:34,519 --> 00:01:35,840
I'm Mian?

19
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:38,319
Think about it.

20
00:01:39,599 --> 00:01:41,200
Who played along with you back then?

21
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:43,799
Without me,

22
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:46,159
you'd still be in prison.

23
00:01:47,239 --> 00:01:48,239
I never would've known that.

24
00:01:49,319 --> 00:01:50,680
Guess I was showing off to a pro.

25
00:01:52,599 --> 00:01:53,079
Mian.

26
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,959
He can't just give the money away.

27
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:56,400
You need to rein him in.

28
00:01:59,599 --> 00:02:00,280
Looks like

29
00:02:01,239 --> 00:02:02,560
you all have quite a problem

30
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,079
with me.

31
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,359
Good.

32
00:02:06,799 --> 00:02:07,239
Then today,

33
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,039
right here in front of everyone,

34
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,639
I'm making it official.

35
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:11,960
Zhou Yan

36
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:14,000
is my successor.

37
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,080
The BlackGold Key...

38
00:02:16,599 --> 00:02:17,919
I entrusted it to him.

39
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:20,479
You're trying to make me the target.

40
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:23,560
Looks like we're evenly matched.

41
00:02:26,439 --> 00:02:28,120
He said he'd split the money.

42
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:28,800
I don't trust him.

43
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,439
General,

44
00:02:30,439 --> 00:02:31,080
don't worry.

45
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:32,680
Zhou Yan is my son-in-law.

46
00:02:33,639 --> 00:02:34,439
I trust him.

47
00:02:34,953 --> 00:02:35,560
Besides,

48
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,240
the BlackGold account

49
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,360
takes a second key to open.

50
00:02:40,319 --> 00:02:40,800
That's how

51
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:43,840
we keep everyone's money safe.

52
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:44,800
There's another key?

53
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:45,639
Yeah.

54
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:48,800
Be a good son-in-law,

55
00:02:49,479 --> 00:02:50,800
and I'll tell you everything.

56
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,680
Since Dad thinks so highly of Zhou Yan,

57
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:00,960
Zhou Yan,

58
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,159
we should serve tea to Dad.

59
00:03:03,639 --> 00:03:04,039
Dad.

60
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:05,400
All right.

61
00:03:06,319 --> 00:03:06,840
Have some tea.

62
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:15,560
Dad.

63
00:03:16,039 --> 00:03:16,680
Please have some tea.

64
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,199
Dad.

65
00:03:47,479 --> 00:03:48,319
I'm sorry.

66
00:03:48,319 --> 00:03:49,240
I'm sorry.

67
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:52,639
I'm sorry.

68
00:03:54,876 --> 00:03:56,576
You... you...

69
00:03:58,439 --> 00:03:58,879
Bomb!

70
00:04:01,319 --> 00:04:01,840
Look out!

71
00:04:19,879 --> 00:04:20,199
Mona!

72
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:21,079
Go!

73
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:21,600
Go!

74
00:04:41,639 --> 00:04:42,160
Help!

75
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:46,680
Are you okay?

76
00:04:47,959 --> 00:04:48,439
Zhou Yan.

77
00:04:49,439 --> 00:04:51,199
I've been a plaything for men
my whole life.

78
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,000
It wasn't until I met you

79
00:04:53,399 --> 00:04:54,399
that my life meant something.

80
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,879
Forget all that.

81
00:04:56,319 --> 00:04:57,040
Just stay alive.

82
00:04:57,519 --> 00:04:58,192
Get out of here alive.

83
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,800
Where exactly is the BlackGold Key?

84
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,079
Until Mian shows up himself,

85
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,959
I'm not giving you the key.

86
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:09,519
Talk!

87
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:21,399
Get her out of here!

88
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:22,759
Layla, let's go!

89
00:05:22,959 --> 00:05:23,480
Zhou Yan.

90
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:23,879
Go!

91
00:05:23,879 --> 00:05:24,360
Zhou Yan.

92
00:05:24,639 --> 00:05:25,040
Zhou Yan.

93
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,160
You're crazy! I was trying to kill you!

94
00:05:26,319 --> 00:05:27,720
But I couldn't let you die!

95
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,000
Dad!

96
00:05:35,319 --> 00:05:36,160
Get police backup, now!

97
00:05:37,839 --> 00:05:38,360
That way!

98
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,079
Come on!

99
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:42,560
Stop!

100
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:42,839
Don't move!

101
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:46,879
Dad!

102
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,000
Dad!

103
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:54,360
Mona!

104
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:54,680
Go!

105
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:55,639
Hurry!

106
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,319
Dad!

107
00:05:56,319 --> 00:05:56,680
Go!

108
00:06:00,393 --> 00:06:00,759
Go!

109
00:06:00,783 --> 00:06:01,124
Hurry!

110
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:01,772
Go!

111
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,120
Dad!

112
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,560
Mona, go!

113
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:06,480
Run!

114
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,040
Dad!

115
00:06:11,399 --> 00:06:12,720
Hurry!

116
00:06:48,439 --> 00:06:48,839
Hey!

117
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,199
Where are you going?

118
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:52,639
Ma Ding?

119
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:53,839
Five hundred.

120
00:06:54,279 --> 00:06:54,600
Ride it yourself.

121
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:56,519
Those clothes stand out too much.

122
00:06:56,519 --> 00:06:57,000
Change your clothes.

123
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:04,439
What about you?

124
00:07:04,959 --> 00:07:05,240
Boss.

125
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,879
You and Mona have bigger things to do.

126
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:08,480
Leave these punks to me.

127
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:09,240
But you...

128
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:09,759
No.

129
00:07:10,319 --> 00:07:10,959
You have to go now too.

130
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,439
You're the god of Langia.

131
00:07:12,639 --> 00:07:13,600
You've got the guts to take on Mian.

132
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:14,959
But I'm more ruthless than you.

133
00:07:15,279 --> 00:07:16,079
You save Langia.

134
00:07:16,079 --> 00:07:16,519
I'll save you.

135
00:07:23,879 --> 00:07:24,519
Now go!

136
00:07:30,399 --> 00:07:31,040
Come back alive.

137
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:39,600
Kill them!

138
00:07:45,839 --> 00:07:46,580
Langia's future

139
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:47,439
is yours to change.

140
00:07:47,469 --> 00:07:49,511
♪Through tears and scars♪

141
00:07:49,523 --> 00:07:51,209
♪You stayed right by my side♪

142
00:07:51,233 --> 00:07:52,988
♪Here's a toast to the past♪

143
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,813
♪To the brotherhood we shared♪

144
00:07:54,843 --> 00:07:57,563
♪When I look back,
I'm alone, gazing at the moon♪

145
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:25,600
It's Ren.

146
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:28,560
I'll hold him off.

147
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:29,720
No.

148
00:08:30,839 --> 00:08:31,399
Layla said

149
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,960
BlackGold is Mian's biggest secret.

150
00:08:33,399 --> 00:08:34,799
He wouldn't trust it to anyone else.

151
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:36,639
He'll definitely come in person.

152
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:37,639
Go on in.

153
00:08:39,879 --> 00:08:40,799
You must stay alive.

154
00:08:41,559 --> 00:08:41,879
I will.

155
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:57,799
The BlackGold Key is your last lifeline.

156
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,000
And you just left it at Ma Ding's place?

157
00:09:00,639 --> 00:09:01,000
Yes.

158
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,360
I didn't get to ask you last time.

159
00:09:07,759 --> 00:09:09,039
Why are you so loyal to Mian?

160
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:42,600
Ten years ago,

161
00:09:43,799 --> 00:09:45,840
I came to Langia with my family
to do business.

162
00:09:46,919 --> 00:09:47,919
Then we got double-crossed.

163
00:09:49,399 --> 00:09:50,799
My whole family was gunned down.

164
00:09:59,799 --> 00:10:00,440
This bullet

165
00:10:01,919 --> 00:10:02,840
nearly killed me.

166
00:10:06,519 --> 00:10:07,320
Mian saved me.

167
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:09,720
He's the reason I'm still alive.

168
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:15,240
I've killed a lot of people for him.

169
00:10:24,759 --> 00:10:25,240
This...

170
00:10:26,519 --> 00:10:27,240
will be the last one.

171
00:10:28,399 --> 00:10:28,799
Bro,

172
00:10:30,559 --> 00:10:31,759
don't make this hard for me.

173
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:37,639
Has Mian always called you Ren?

174
00:10:42,399 --> 00:10:43,240
My name is Shao Zhongren.

175
00:11:06,519 --> 00:11:07,240
The BlackGold Key

176
00:11:07,879 --> 00:11:08,559
is in that house.

177
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:10,919
Good work.

178
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,080
You saved my life.

179
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,279
Serving you

180
00:11:14,919 --> 00:11:15,399
is the least I can do.

181
00:11:15,919 --> 00:11:16,799
When I decided

182
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:19,240
I needed a shadow

183
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,720
who was absolutely loyal
and had no ties,

184
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,159
I chose you.

185
00:11:23,759 --> 00:11:24,240
So...

186
00:11:25,159 --> 00:11:25,919
your family...

187
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:28,080
I was the one who had them killed.

188
00:11:32,092 --> 00:11:32,399
You...

189
00:11:33,639 --> 00:11:34,360
What are you talking about?

190
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:39,960
I don't understand.

191
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:41,799
With no ties,

192
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:43,519
you could devote yourself

193
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,639
completely

194
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,159
to serving as my blade.

195
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,285
♪Dust rises along the border♪

196
00:12:14,310 --> 00:12:15,630
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

197
00:12:15,630 --> 00:12:16,990
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

198
00:12:16,990 --> 00:12:18,323
♪Brothers yesterday, foes today♪

199
00:12:18,348 --> 00:12:19,543
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

200
00:12:19,567 --> 00:12:20,887
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

201
00:12:20,911 --> 00:12:22,231
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

202
00:12:22,255 --> 00:12:23,935
♪My life is mine to bear♪

203
00:12:23,959 --> 00:12:26,319
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

204
00:12:26,569 --> 00:12:29,169
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

205
00:12:29,246 --> 00:12:31,520
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

206
00:12:31,520 --> 00:12:32,935
♪My fate is mine to command♪

207
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:34,096
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

208
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,534
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

209
00:12:35,559 --> 00:12:36,895
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

210
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:38,254
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

211
00:12:38,279 --> 00:12:39,514
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

212
00:12:39,539 --> 00:12:40,961
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

213
00:12:40,986 --> 00:12:42,274
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

214
00:12:42,299 --> 00:12:43,527
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

215
00:12:43,552 --> 00:12:45,007
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

216
00:12:45,031 --> 00:12:46,339
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

217
00:12:46,363 --> 00:12:47,423
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

218
00:12:47,447 --> 00:12:48,751
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

219
00:12:48,775 --> 00:12:53,041
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

220
00:12:54,543 --> 00:12:55,624
♪With blood and sweat♪

221
00:12:55,648 --> 00:12:57,107
♪I forge my glory♪

222
00:12:57,131 --> 00:12:58,267
♪In this world of chaos♪

223
00:12:58,291 --> 00:12:59,571
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

224
00:12:59,595 --> 00:13:00,941
♪My legend♪

225
00:13:00,965 --> 00:13:02,485
♪I'll write every chapter myself♪

226
00:13:07,202 --> 00:13:09,534
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

227
00:13:09,558 --> 00:13:12,121
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

228
00:13:12,429 --> 00:13:14,623
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

229
00:13:14,647 --> 00:13:15,940
♪My fate is mine to command♪

230
00:13:15,964 --> 00:13:17,286
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

231
